1
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,060
What I just said was to refute him.

2
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,660
I didn't mean anything else.

3
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:39,600
Really?

4
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,160
Really.

5
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:52,560
Okay, but I'm sick now.

6
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,200
I need you to wipe my body.

7
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:02,460
It's not like you're too sick
to lift your arms.

8
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,830
It's not like you haven't
touched it before.

9
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:22,560
Don't let your hands shake.

10
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:25,860
I say, girl,

11
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:27,730
wiping here,

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,660
are you trying to make
something happen with me?

13
00:01:34,630 --> 00:01:35,430
Ah, no,

14
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:36,900
I didn't mean to.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,759
That's about it.

16
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:38,660
I'm leaving.

17
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:42,460
Trying to run after starting a fire?

18
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:43,700
Ah!

19
00:01:59,729 --> 00:02:02,060
Mister, I'll go brew your medicine first.

20
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,530
Blushing like this.

21
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:15,630
Could it be...

22
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:20,030
Hey, wild girl,

23
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,060
there's something I need to make clear.

24
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:26,200
My father saved
the Sect Leader's life back then.

25
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,460
Before he died,

26
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,730
the Sect Leader promised

27
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:30,390
to marry me to repay the favor.

28
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:32,090
You'd better watch yourself.

29
00:02:36,829 --> 00:02:38,460
He has a fiancée?

30
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:40,460
Then just now he...

31
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:46,360
Madam, the medicine is ready.

32
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,020
The Sect Leader asked you
to deliver it quickly.

33
00:02:49,930 --> 00:02:51,060
I got it.

34
00:02:53,730 --> 00:02:56,860
He has a fiancée
but still allows others to call me Madam.

35
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,630
Sect Leader, be gentle.

36
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,430
You're hurting me.

37
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:03,330
Oh,

38
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,230
then I'll stop.

39
00:03:05,730 --> 00:03:07,000
No.

40
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,460
Asking me to deliver
the medicine personally

41
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,700
just for this scene.

42
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:25,500
A wild girl indeed.

43
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:28,390
She can't even see through
an auditory illusion.

44
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,820
Bai Ze of Yungong Pavilion

45
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,030
really did me a big favor.

46
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:50,260
With the wild girl taken away by him,

47
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:52,060
the Sect Leader is all mine.

48
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:55,760
Sect Leader,
I'm here to deliver the medicine.

49
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:57,630
Why is it you?

50
00:03:57,860 --> 00:03:58,800
Where is A Kong?

51
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,200
She left the medicine bowl at the door

52
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,630
and left with a man.

53
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:04,230
It seemed to be Bai Ze.

54
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:05,630
What did you say?

55
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,430
Auditory illusion.

56
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:20,660
You'd better pray nothing happened to her.

57
00:04:24,130 --> 00:04:24,930
Mr. Bai,

58
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:27,100
what exactly do you want from me?

59
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,900
Didn't you say you wanted
to leave Young Master Yan?

60
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,260
I happen to need a wife.

61
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:37,360
Why don't you marry me?

62
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:40,760
What nonsense are you talking about?

63
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:44,430
After we get married, we'll live here.

64
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,900
I'll take care of you,

65
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:48,230
and you'll plow the fields, weave,

66
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:50,560
carry water, and water the garden.

67
00:04:53,659 --> 00:04:56,320
There should be a limit
to being shameless, hey!

68
00:05:01,260 --> 00:05:02,660
I want to support myself.

69
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:04,720
Do you know where I can make money?

70
00:05:05,930 --> 00:05:06,730
Make money?

71
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:08,960
Qiong City, of course.

72
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:13,660
Qiong City?

73
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:16,360
But the Qi residence is also there.

74
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,090
Afraid of running into your old flame?

75
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,330
I told you to just marry me.

76
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:31,230
Let's go.

77
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,330
To Qiong City.

78
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:38,000
It's a medical bounty posted
by the Shangguan family.

79
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,159
A medical bounty?

80
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,460
Little one.

81
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:45,490
You know medicine, right?

82
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,860
Just a little.

83
00:05:49,330 --> 00:05:51,130
I wouldn't dare take the notice.

84
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:56,260
Ah!

85
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:00,860
Who took the notice?

86
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:02,030
Was it this lady?

87
00:06:02,730 --> 00:06:03,630
Bai Ze,

88
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,760
just you wait!
